silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_27_governance_shacl_deep_dive_sections_03_unified_constraint_theorem_concrete_anchor_2#shacl_shapeforms silm:hasLongDescription "The SHACL_ShapeForms is concrete SHACL shape forms: WeightObservation, IdentifierConstraint, ProvenanceShape. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'SHACL_ShapeForms', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
